Spec: Data models

Purpose:
  Persistent domain data for courses, lessons and holidays, stored in SQLite through FastHTML's built-in database
  support.

Owns:
  ./models.py

Must:
  The database file path is `/data/app.db`.
  A Course has a name and a display color used for lesson squares.
  A Lesson has a date, a reference to a Course and free-text details.
  A Holiday has a date and a name.
  Tables are created automatically on startup when they do not exist.

Tasks:
  [ ] Implement @Course, @Lesson and @Holiday and database initialization
  [ ] [?] Decide whether lessons and holidays can be deleted, and whether more than one lesson may exist per day and course
